g-plan-tdd-bdd-ddl-atdd.md` — Overview document with 5 chapters + roadmap\n     - `doc/features/phase-0-infrastructure.md` — Phase 0 detailed plan (complete)\n     - `doc/features/phase-1-tdd-bdd.md` — Phase 1 detailed plan (complete)\n     - `doc/features/phase-2-ddd.md` — Phase 2 detailed plan (complete)\n     - `doc/features/phase-3-dsl.md` — Phase 3 detailed plan (complete)\n     - **Phase 4 ATDD document NOT yet created**\n\n4. Errors and Fixes:\n   - **git pull conflict**: Local changes in `win32-foreground.log` blocked pull. Fixed with `git stash && git pull && git stash pop`. Then stash pop caused merge conflict — resolved with `git checkout --theirs` and `git stash drop`.\n   - **Test failures identified**: `tests/e2e` — 6 tests FAIL (missing `testdata/fixtures/*.json` files); `tests/sse` — `TestChatCompletionsUsageNormalization` FAIL (`expected usage to be map[string]int64, got <nil>`). These are documented as Phase 0 tasks to fix.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Identified that the codebase has anemic domain models, zero unit tests for domain/service/store, God Service pattern in StatusService, duplicate type definitions between domain/ and store/, and monolithic reverse.go\n   - Designed a 5-phase refactoring plan with clear dependencies: Phase 0 (infra) → Phase 1 (tests) → Phase 2 (DDD) → Phase 3 (DSL) → Phase 4 (ATDD)\n   - Created detailed phase documents with task lists, modification principles, constraints, deliverables, and acceptance checkpoints\n\n6. All User Messages:\n   - \"git pull\"\n   - \"我想根据TDD 测试驱动 BDD 行为驱动 DDD 领域驱动 DSL 领域语言 ATDD 验收驱动 以上这几个理论指定一个重构方案的\"\n   - (Answered clarifying questions: scope = \"仅 claude_tap_plus/ Go 侧\", format = \"文档方案 (doc/)\", theory relationship = \"独立章节\")\n   - \"请你将这个列出来的，每一个阶段的详细计划，只需要有对应的计划，以及对应的修改的原则，生产出来还有对应的约束的\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - **Phase 4 ATDD detailed plan document** has NOT been created yet (`doc/features/phase-4-atdd.md`)\n   - Task #2 \"生成各阶段详细执行计划文档\" is still `in_progress` — Phase 4 remains\n   - After all phase documents are created, Task #2 should be marked completed\n\n8. Current Work:\n   I was generating detailed phase execution plan documents for the user's request to produce per-phase plans with principles and constraints. I had completed Phase 0, Phase 1, Phase 2, and Phase 3 documents. The Phase 4 (ATDD — Acceptance Test-Driven Development) document was the next file to write when the summary was requested. Each document follows the same structure: 任务清单 (task list with numbered operations), 修改原则 (modification principles P-x-1 through P-x-5), 约束条件 (constraints C-x-1 through C-x-6), 产出物 (deliverables table), and 验收检查点 (acceptance checkpoint bash commands).\n\n   The Phase 4 ATDD plan should cover (from the overview document):\n   - End-to-end acceptance test scenarios (E2E-1 Issue complete lifecycle, E2E-2 Session lifecycle + auto-release, E2E-3 concurrent competition, E2E-4 backend degradation)\n   - API endpoint acceptance criteria table\n   - Test files in `tests/acceptance/` directory\n   - `AcceptanceTestEnv` helper for starting real backend server on random port\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Create the Phase 4 ATDD detailed plan document at `doc/features/phase-4-atdd.md`, following the same structure as the other phase documents (task list, modification principles, constraints, deliverables, acceptance checkpoints). This directly continues the user's request: \"请你将这个列出来的，每一个阶段的详细计划，只需要有对应的计划，以及对应的修改的原则，生产出来还有对应的约束的\". After completing Phase 4, mark Task #2 as completed.\n</summary>"}
